                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "232960105",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198160402695",
                            "num_reviews": 20,
                            "playtime_forever": 394,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 394,
                            "last_played": 1786876930
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I enjoyed the story very much. The writing was good and I especially liked the descriptions of the manor. The characters didn't feel flat and felt like real people (I need to replay this for Bastian). However, the ending felt a bit too fast paced and it came off as being rushed.\nThe lack of a saving feature is a detriment to the replayability of the story, as you have to play the entire story again just to make a few different decisions. \nI understand it's to give weight to the decisions you do make in the game, but a good middle ground, at least in my opinion, would be to allow for going back in the text for a second playthrough. \n\nThe spicier scenes were also well written and while I did enjoy them I was a bit disappointed that choosing to be trans didn't have any effect on them (at least for Dev). Writing several scenes to account for the different combinations of pronouns and genitals would be a lot more work, but it would've made the scenes more impactful for me.\n",
                        "timestamp_created": 1786877982,
